---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-[#1e1e1e] mt-12 py-8 px-6 text-[10px] font-mono text-dim">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-y-3 sm:gap-y-0 justify-between">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-x-2">
      <span>© {year} Black Ops Archive — Steven Baird</span>
      <span class="hidden sm:inline text-[#2a2a2a]">·</span>
      <span class="text-[9px] text-[#4a4a4a]">Primary sources only. Documented history.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em]">
      <a href="/rss.xml" class="hover:text-classified-green transition-colors">RSS</a>
      <a href="/archive" class="hover:text-classified-green transition-colors">Archive</a>
      <a href="/agency" class="hover:text-classified-green transition-colors">Agencies</a>
      <a href="/timeline" class="hover:text-classified-green transition-colors">Timeline</a>
      <a href="/about" class="hover:text-classified-green transition-colors">Methodology</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-[#1a1a1a] text-[9px] text-[#3a3a3a]">
    Scope: CIA, MI6, Mossad, NSA, FBI, GCHQ, KGB/FSB, BND, Joint Chiefs and documented allied operations. No speculation.
  </div>
</footer>
